@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### Daftar karyawan (halaman 1)
GET {{base}}/karyawan
Accept: application/json

### Pencarian
GET {{base}}/karyawan?cari=a
Accept: application/json

### Tambah karyawan
POST {{base}}/karyawan
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kode": "KRY-9001", "nama": "Contoh Karyawan", "jabatan": "Analis", "divisi_id": 1 }

### Tambah dengan data SALAH (harus 422)
POST {{base}}/karyawan
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nama": "" }

### Ubah karyawan
PUT {{base}}/karyawan/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kode": "KRY-9002", "nama": "Nama Baru", "jabatan": "Staf", "divisi_id": 2 }

### Hapus karyawan
DELETE {{base}}/karyawan/1
Accept: application/json

### Divisi dan jumlah karyawan
GET {{base}}/divisi
Accept: application/json